{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "679f06aa-4c70-8e84-ac23-580d36f1518b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:45:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha F. Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Aisha Patel. I'm calling because a tree came down at my rental property, out on Ocean Avenue. Well, not the whole tree came down, the roots pulled right up out of the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Roots pulled up. And what's the address there, Mrs. Patel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One seventy-three Ocean Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One seventy-three Ocean Avenue. Got it. And when did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was the nor'easter, the one from Friday into Saturday. Three days ago now. I didn't see it until my tenant told me Saturday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the tree down across the road or a sidewalk, or is it on the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tipped over, the roots are up in the air like a big plate. [pause] Hold on, I'm just wiping my glasses here, I can't see the paper. Okay. It's leaning, it's not flat on the ground. It's in the front by the edge of the yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is it touching any wires or the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not the house. There's a wire up there but I couldn't tell you if it's touching. I'm eighty-some years old, I'm not standing under it to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you don't need to. So here's my question back, you want to know who handles it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Who do I call? Is it the city, or is it me as the owner, or the electric company? Somebody told me three different things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on where the tree is standing. If it's on the city's right of way, between the sidewalk and the street, then the city would look at it. If it's on your private property, it's generally the owner's responsibility to have it removed. And if it's in the wires, that's the utility, and you'd call them directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have to figure out where the property line is first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the first step, yes. I can take down the address and have someone from our office check whether it's a city tree. Can I put your number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. And it's one seventy-three Ocean Avenue, roots lifted after the storm, tree leaning, possible wire nearby."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send that over to be looked at. If someone sees it's on private property they'll let you know. In the meantime, if you think it's near the wires, call the electric company about that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:45:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll do that. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
